    "text": "@[category research open, AMS 5]\ntheorem numTransversalsZn : answer(sorry) ↔\n      ∃ᵉ (c₁ > (0 : ℝ)) (c₂ < (1 : ℝ)) (_ : c₁ < c₂),\n      ∀ n ≥ 3, Odd n →\n        (z n : ℝ) ∈ Set.Icc (c₁ ^ n * n.factorial) (c₂ ^ n * n.factorial)",
